    "body": ":::note 26 / 10 / 2026 - A lil Journey\n# Huh?\nHenloo ~\n\nI will be going on a little journey for a week, should still be able to update, play a little and so on.. However, can't guarantee it!\n\nThis is my first proper break in a while, so I'm excited and a little nervous. Hopefully I can slow down, enjoy it and come back with a few things to write about ~\n\nThat said, I'll try to post cause tomorrow's Nikke anniersary and I'm absolutely playing and pulling, I'll take screenshots if I get good stuff.. PLEASE CROWN COME HOMEEEE.\n\n## On today's news\nFew things are dropping today and tomorrow, I almost forgor.. I'm busy af give me a break.\nI don't plan on adding more games to my mobile rotation, currently playing:\n- GBF although more seasonally than everyday.\n- Nikke same as GBF, It's on my phone which means I keep it in rotation even if I dont play for a week.\n\nI occasionally (mostly during big celebrations) play Dokkan. Dropped almost completely HSR. I'd like to play ZZZ or get into it more seriously, I'll see about it. I used to play WuWa a lot but I kinda put it on pause, too much stuff going on.\nThis is the list kinda, outside of 1-2 games that I keep on phone, rest is a roll.\n\n### Bleach Mirror's High\nSooo, I completely forgot about Bleach Mirror's High coming out(?).. I played a little, it's Legends but Bleach.. I like it so far, although I've seen some annoying restrictions, hmm.\n\n### Monster Hunter Outlanders\nI remembered this one, it's not playable yet but it should be soon, going to give it a go BUT.. I've seen negative comments about the publishers of whom I'm familliar with, there's a chance game goes p2w or at least heavily monetized.. we will see, anyway I don't know how comfy a MH game is on a phone, first time for me.\n:::"
