    "body": ":::note 24 / 10 / 2026 - Pleasant surprise\nFew days ago a friend kindly sent me an invitation for Deadlock! I was honestly not aware that it was invitation only as I didn't pay much attention on how to get the game. I've seen lots of positive feedbacks about the game but I've been away from competitive shooters and MOBAs for a while and, outside of few videos and people talking about the game, I didn't really check it out properly.\n\nTo my surprise, after playing for a little.. the game is quite fun ~\nI was sceptical sort of, since I played my fair amount of this genre.. so I though \"what else could be brought the table?\" And I was proven wrong, luckily. Game is a mix of shooter and moba, you get the 3rd person shooting part with some mechanics from mobas. It's simple, lots of characters to play, straightforward. I like it.\n\nPerformance wise, despite being an alpha, it runs quite well and I haven't experienced technical issues,  for now..\n\nI'm going to invite few other friends a probably play it more, I'm intrigued!\n:::"
