    "body": ":::note 20 / 10 / 2026 - New Note\nSooo, yeah I'm back and at full speed.. no, not full speed, but definitely back.\nGestalt is changing. I've picked up where I left off and I'm making improvements all around. There's been a lot going on, so here's the breakdown since the last commit/push:\n\n- Polished window controls, the local editing gear, and Contents positioning.\n- Refined Notes into cleaner dated rows with more comfortable reading space.\n- Made Logs more contextual: automatic overview snippets, no irrelevant progress bar, and attachments only when present.\n- Adjusted dashboard spacing and prevented the background showing through initialization.\n- Fixed cache-version handling and styling conflicts in older notes.\n- Improved Studio save/export recovery, partial-save handling, and failed-push retries.\n- Made publishing asynchronous and protected conflicting Studio operations.\n- Hardened media upload validation and documented the architecture, workflow, and remaining work.\n- Fixed how cached images refresh, so replacing a picture doesn't leave the old one stuck there forever.\n- Added the groundwork for automatic Steam updates and connected the dashboard readers. The hosted refresh still needs to be set up, so it's not automatic just yet.\n\nStill ahead: enabling the hosted Steam updates, improving the note-writing tools, and the remaining Firefox performance investigation.\nThere's more cool stuff coming but I won't say much for now hehe.\n\nI haven't forgotten about the other projects, but I'm not ready to tackle them YET. I do plan to finish them, of course. I don't like leaving things hanging or unfinished, so.. they will get done, eventually.\nThis note was mostly technical. I'll talk more about where I'm at with games and general topics in the next note!\n:::"
